@startuml
title Library
left to right direction
actor Member
actor :Librarian: as Staff
rectangle Library {
  (Borrow book) as Borrow
  (Return book) as Return
  (Check account) as Check
  (Renew loan)/ as Renew
}
Member --> Borrow
Member --> Return
Staff --> Check
Borrow .> Check : <<include>>
Renew .> Borrow : <<extend>>
note right of Staff : at the desk
@enduml
